# Netlify redirect rules, read top to bottom (the first match wins).
#
# FUTURE DOMAIN, INACTIVE: the two lines starting with "# https://" are switched on only once houcine.world is
# the site's primary domain on Netlify (Domain management) and its certificate is issued; then remove the "# "
